{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2014-03", "window": 4, "start_date": 1395619200, "end_date": 1396310399, "month_true_total": 229, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:08:14 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "9689804", "author": {"steamid": "76561198004792466", "personaname": "JoelFantastic", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/joelfantastic253/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 7177, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3046, "last_played": 1552803201, "avatar": "2ef30f6dea773d490193d579c9641f46536cd504"}, "language": "english", "review": "Addicting.", "timestamp_created": 1396305824, "timestamp_updated": 1396305824, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9687379", "author": {"steamid": "76561198016231061", "personaname": "Iri", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/liqridium/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 1015, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 998, "last_played": 1427146651, "avatar": "f61a1c2e9ee05236d6cbc89add14976eb05b6cd9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Such an awesome game!! super simple and yet with a lot of entertainment value! Pretty challenging! 8/10", "timestamp_created": 1396287869, "timestamp_updated": 1396287869, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9686969", "author": {"steamid": "76561198047124148", "personaname": "deathberry", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/okami11235/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 3090, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1437, "last_played": 1589085183, "avatar": "f32609806743504b822c44e87d5b885bfd3972d0"}, "language": "english", "review": "A wonderful little thing to take up a free hour or two, or at least until you get frustrated.\nLike most rogue-style games, this can quickly be the case. Although it might start slow, once you play a bit and get your hands on some of the better unlockable items and characters, the game opens right up.\n\nThe game itself has some charming (albeit cliched) 8-bit style graphics, and what amounts to a limited, but still beautiful soundtrack. The controls are simple, binding one key to each of your 4 abilities (which vary depending on your character), one for generic actions, and one for item usage.\n\nThe variation among use items, ability-enhancing items, and characters is quite large, and you should find some variety between each playthrough (depending on your skill level and difficulty settings, this may take anywhere from 30 minutes to two hours), although there is some clear advantage to certain sets, so you may find yourself gravitating towards those more often, and even seeing a huge difference in challenge on the same difficulty level.\n\nAll in all, it's fun if you're into it. Like any other rogue, it's not the most forgiving game, but with a little practice, you'll definitely be shooting for the final boss.", "timestamp_created": 1396284655, "timestamp_updated": 1396284655, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9684836", "author": {"steamid": "76561198026409579", "personaname": "parmesano", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198026409579/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 2786, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2131, "last_played": 1682238118, "avatar": "84bebd898433b8c397d13792f6a9dfeb6c33734d"}, "language": "english", "review": "11/10 - it was okay", "timestamp_created": 1396267070, "timestamp_updated": 1396267070, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.538709700107574463", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9684505", "author": {"steamid": "76561198015212610", "personaname": "READ PALE", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198015212610/", "num_games_owned": 347, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 2930, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1468, "last_played": 1551568582, "avatar": "bd3d2eafc019efc6795f33d8792bfbe6954cb8bb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very fun and addicting. Offers both easytime and challenge. Each of the 10 classes has a different playstyle, from relaxing run'n'shoot to managing a turret and mine supply or having to reload after each shot. There are no purely negative or useless items, and same items stack, so every treasure chest is worth opening. All of this creates a great action roguelike experience.", "timestamp_created": 1396263891, "timestamp_updated": 1396263891, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.525862038135528564", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}